## 8. Troubleshooting

| Issue | Check |
|-------|--------|
| No `artifacts/` | Run from `simple_aiops_pipeline/` so `ARTIFACTS_DIR` resolves next to `pipeline.py`. |
| F1 is low | Tune `Z_THRESHOLD`, `WINDOW`, or injection pattern in `stage_prepare`. |
| All NaN z | Increase `N_POINTS` or lower `WINDOW` so enough rows exist after `min_periods`. |

